{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "初始化缺失",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 119.64,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "普通合约用构造函数设置主人。代理合约不行。",
   "spoken": "普通合约用构造函数设置主人。代理合约不行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.425
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "构造函数只在实现合约自己的存储里运行，写不进代理。",
   "spoken": "构造函数只在实现合约自己的存储里运行，写不进代理。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.82,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 5.82,
   "speechEnd": 10.587
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "所以可升级合约用一个初始化函数代替，部署以后再调用一次。",
   "spoken": "所以可升级合约用一个初始化函数代替，部署以后再掉用一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 11.0,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 11.092,
   "speechEnd": 16.05
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "这一次调用，就是风险所在。",
   "spoken": "这一次掉用，就是风险所在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 16.5,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 16.599,
   "speechEnd": 18.693
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "第一种情况：部署代理和初始化，分成了两笔交易。",
   "spoken": "第一种情况：部署代理和初始化，分成了两笔交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.12,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 19.214,
   "speechEnd": 23.208
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "中间有空隙，别人可以抢先初始化，成为主人。修复是在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "spoken": "中间有空隙，别人可以抢先初始化，成为主人。修复是在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 23.66,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 23.756,
   "speechEnd": 30.441
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第二种：初始化函数可以重复调用，任何人都能重置主人。修复是加上只能调用一次的修饰器。",
   "spoken": "第二种：初始化函数可以虫复掉用，任何人都能虫置主人。修复是加上只能掉用一次的修饰器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 30.84,
   "dur": 9.36,
   "speechStart": 30.934,
   "speechEnd": 40.006
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "第三种：代理初始化了，实现合约本身没有。",
   "spoken": "第三种：代理初始化了，实现合约本身没有。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 40.42,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 40.511,
   "speechEnd": 43.849
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "代理的初始化，写在代理的存储里。实现合约自己的存储，还是空的。",
   "spoken": "代理的初始化，写在代理的存储里。实现合约自己的存储，还是空的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 44.24,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 44.332,
   "speechEnd": 49.554
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。别人能直接调用实现合约的初始化函数吗？",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。别人能直接掉用实现合约的初始化函数吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 49.98,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 49.98,
   "speechEnd": 55.056
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "能。他会成为实现合约的主人。",
   "spoken": "能。他会成为实现合约的主人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 55.76,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 55.76,
   "speechEnd": 58.714
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "如果实现合约里有 delegatecall 或者自毁的路径，所有指向它的代理，都可能失效。",
   "spoken": "如果实现合约里有 delegatecall 或者自毁的路径，所有指向它的代理，都可能失效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 59.18,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 59.277,
   "speechEnd": 65.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2021 年 9 月，OpenZeppelin 发布安全公告：它的 UUPS 实现，有几个版本存在这个问题，随后发布了修复版本。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 9 月，OpenZeppelin 发布安全公告：它的 UUPS 实现，有几个版本存在这个问题，随后发布了修复版本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 65.88,
   "dur": 9.04,
   "speechStart": 65.987,
   "speechEnd": 74.725
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "修复是在实现合约的构造函数里，禁用初始化。这样谁都不能再初始化它。",
   "spoken": "修复是在实现合约的构造函数里，禁用初始化。这样谁都不能再初始化它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 75.14,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 75.14,
   "speechEnd": 81.667
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "回到开头的 Nomad。它的问题，出在升级时的初始化参数。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的 Nomad。它的问题，出在升级时的初始化参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 82.08,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 82.08,
   "speechEnd": 86.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "合约用一张表，记录每个根什么时候被确认。升级把全零这个根，标记成了已确认。",
   "spoken": "合约用一张表，记录每个根什么时候被确认。升级把全零这个根，标记成了已确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 86.94,
   "dur": 7.76,
   "speechStart": 86.94,
   "speechEnd": 94.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "而没被证明过的消息，查到的根，默认也是全零。",
   "spoken": "而没被证明过的消息，查到的根，默认也是全零。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 94.92,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 95.021,
   "speechEnd": 99.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "默认值和合法值，撞在了一起。",
   "spoken": "默认值和合法值，撞在了一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 99.54,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 99.632,
   "speechEnd": 102.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "教训有三条。初始化参数，和代码一样需要审计。",
   "spoken": "教训有三条。初始化参数，和代码一样需要审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 102.48,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 102.48,
   "speechEnd": 106.76
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "零值不能带有业务含义，默认值必须和合法值区分开。",
   "spoken": "零值不能带有业务含义，默认值必须和合法值区分开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 107.18,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 107.18,
   "speechEnd": 112.083
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "升级以后要跑回归测试，覆盖这一条：未授权的消息必须被拒绝。",
   "spoken": "升级以后要跑回归测试，覆盖这一条：未授权的消息必须被拒绝。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 112.52,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 112.52,
   "speechEnd": 118.292
  }
